      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>While moogle legends describe Moggle Mog as a kind, benevolent presence, the primal summoned by Mooglesguard is driven by the need to feast on ever-greater amounts of aether along with a large following to further solidify his being. - Moggle Mog</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 28, touch 21, flat-footed 18 (+1 size, +9 dex, +1 dodge, +3 armor, +4 natural)</p><p>HP 110 [169] (13d10+39)</p><p>Fort +11, Ref +17, Will +3</p><p>Weakness Shadow</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., fly 30 ft. (good)</p><p>Melee +1 Dagger +23/+18/+13 (1d3+8/17-20×2) and +1 Dagger +23/+18 (1d3+4/17-20)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>STR 24, DEX 28, CON 16, INT 12, WIS 8, CHA 20</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +19; CMD +38</p><p>Feats Dodge, Improved Critical (Dagger), Improved Two-weapon Fighting, Mobility, Two-weapon Fighting, Weapon Finesse, Weapon Focus (Dagger)</p><p>Skills Fly +29</p><p>SQ Outsider traits, Does not Breathe, Does not Eat, Does not Sleep</p>"
